  Dialogue:
  - Time: 92
    Dialogue:
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Well, well, WELL! What a curious little predicament we''ve
        found ourselves in!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]I simply must say, you have got such the interesting little
        world in here!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="you"]It''s not mine'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Oh, don''t be modest! I''m sure you have had a hand in its
        creation somewhere!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="you"]I really haven''t'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]Well, that's rather concerning, actually\u2026"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="you"]Can you ever give it a rest?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]REST?! '
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]Darling, don\u2019t be so SILLY!"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]We are in the middle of a perfectly wonderful production
        and you want an INTERMISSION?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="you"]I want you to stop trying to attack me actually'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Oh, don''t be such a spoilsport!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]WHERE is your sense of whimsy and wonder?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Besides, I haven''t even shown you my best trick yet!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]HA'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]OHHOHOHOO! '
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]HA HA HA'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]OH, you''re going to LOVE this!!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
